    "body": "AI is gaining ground in transportation, but are companies actually turning that potential into results?\nAs supply chains face constant disruption, rising expectations and growing pressure to make faster decisions, the gap between adopting new technology and putting it to work is becoming harder to ignore.\nTo better understand where the industry stands, Blue Yonder and FreightWaves surveyed transportation and logistics decision-makers, combining their insights with industry expertise and real-world examples.\nDownload the white paper to explore:\nHow transportation and logistics leaders are approaching AI adoption\nWhy visibility alone is no longer enough to stay competitive\nThe biggest barriers to AI implementation and supply chain connectivity\nHow companies can move beyond basic visibility to improve collaboration and decision-making\nWhat’s next for AI and the future of transportation\nFill out the form to download the full report.",
